5,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至390% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗中提高攻击力，“眷属”生命值高于一定比例时额外提高攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提高9%，当“眷属”生命值比例不低于60%时，额外提升6%的攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提高12%，当“眷属”生命值比例不低于60%时，额外提升8%的攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提高15%，当“眷属”生命值比例不低于60%时，额外提升10%的攻击力。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","引血为奉"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","“鲜血法阵”额外生成血珠，并且生成血珠时回复一定生命值。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","展开“鲜血法阵”时，会在最初的3秒内额外生成3颗血珠。每次生成血珠时，眷属和苔佩希回复相当于苔佩希200% ATK的生命值。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":49,"end":57,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每次生成血珠时的回复量提升至250% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","苔佩希会为眷属赋予永久的霸体状态，眷属在“鲜血渴望”状态下参与击败敌方非召唤物时，会立即回复40% HP生命值。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":14,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":29,"end":33,"tooltip_key":"keyword:takedown"},{"start":46,"end":52,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","每次生成血珠时的回复量提升至300% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","“鲜血渴望”在满足击败或持续条件后永久持续，并提升眷属造成的伤害。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","当眷属在“鲜血渴望”状态下累计参与击败敌方非召唤物达到2次或累计处于“鲜血渴望”状态12秒后，该状态将永久持续。并且使眷属造成的伤害提升30%。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"keyword:takedown"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","遮月蝠翼伞"]]}